    <title>ep30.30+抗老减脂体验：从血管年轻到生活微习惯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694e0c6c63a654fa60eb86d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694e0c6c63a654fa60eb86d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 04:21:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>30岁后，减肥是否越来越难？明明吃得少、动得多，却瘦不下来？小狗和钱钱都已经过好30岁生日啦，本期节目，钱钱结合日本内科医生池谷敏郎的《抗老生活》一书与自身实践，与大家分享如何通过调整饮食、运动、睡眠与心态，从内到外延缓衰老、轻松减脂，找回年轻状态。</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>⏳ </span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a></span></strong><span> 开场：30+的抗老与减脂困扰</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a></span></strong><span> 推荐《抗老生活》与作者背景</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong><span> 衰老的真相：血管年轻是关键</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a></span></strong><span> 加速衰老的9个习惯自查</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a></span></strong><span> 抗老从生活选择开始</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a></span></strong><span> 饮食三原则：控糖、调序、优选蛋白</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a></span></strong><span> 微运动哲学：餐后僵尸体操与日常隐形运动</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a></span></strong><span> 保持运动动力的4个技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a></span></strong><span> 睡眠、护肤与心态：三大隐形抗老支柱</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a></span></strong><span> 抗老生活四大关键总结</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🔑</span><strong><span> 加速衰老的9个习惯（自查清单）</span></strong></h3><span></span><h2><span>1、爱吃甜食、含糖饮料</span></h2><span></span><p><span>2、早餐靠甜点面包</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、几乎不吃鱼和豆制品</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、怕浪费，总是吃光</span></p><span></span><p><span>5、能坐不站，能躺不坐</span></p><span></span><p><span>6、每天睡眠不足5小时</span></p><span></span><p><span>7、总穿宽松暗色衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span>8、压力大却硬扛</span></p><span></span><p><span>9、回避新事物，不与年轻人交流</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡 从今晚好好睡觉，或明天午餐先吃几口蔬菜开始，“改变不在于一天之间，而在于每一个今天的选择。”让我们一起优雅地与时间相处吧。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/624eb143eea090911200faad/lui285__qGaY3uqnyKLMRlIO9rWA.m4a" length="21595204" type="audio/mp4"/>
