  <item>
    <title>ep29.我们养猫了！自媒体（小红书）变现与理财碎念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691d330bcbba038b423cc73b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691d330bcbba038b423cc73b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Nov 2025 03:07:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，我们养猫了！顺便聊聊自媒体（小红书）尝试稍有成效、宠物赛道、养猫成本、小红书运营技巧，以及上半年理财小结。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6FRWSLDe58eIcLVbA1BhpufigE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-T5iDEW1JZHkWkVqQqXUtD6Z4o.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liVnyBBaiRMf9yO8k_UbqS_ncGfZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🗓️ 时间轴&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a></span></strong><span> 养猫缘起：钱钱捡到橘猫“斧头”</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a></span></strong><span> “斧头”名字的由来</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a></span></strong><span> 斧头的成长记录与外貌特征</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a></span></strong><span> 小红书宠物账号意外走红的开始</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a></span></strong><span> 蒲公英平台开通与商单初体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a></span></strong><span> 宠物行业的未来趋势探讨</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a></span></strong><span> 养猫成本分析：购入、疫苗、猫粮、绝育</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a></span></strong><span> 养猫靠缘分：回忆另一只未收养的小白猫</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a></span></strong><span> 与斧头相遇的暖心故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a></span></strong><span> 养猫的真实成本清单（疫苗、驱虫、猫粮、绝育）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a></span></strong><span> 养猫的时间与精力投入</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a></span></strong><span> 小红书接单原则与案例分享</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a></span></strong><span> 不同自媒体赛道的变现能力对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a></span></strong><span> 小红书运营技巧：封面、发布时间、简介撰写</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a></span></strong><span> 小红书 vs 抖音：平台差异与变现对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2669">44:29</a></span></strong><span> 养猫后的心态变化与“养娃”冲动</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a></span></strong><span> 上半年理财小结：还贷、投资与现金流管理</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>💰 养猫成本清单（以斧头为例）</span></h3><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foi1ZzmkfgzgXDSVVviXDiAc67t5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>📣 互动与联系</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎在评论区分享你的养宠经验或自媒体心得</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎大家小红书关注斧头：@一只叫斧头的橘猫</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/624eb143eea090911200faad/create/%E6%88%91%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%8F%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%A6%E6%94%B6%E8%8E%B7%E4%BA%8621.9%E4%B8%87%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%9E%E4%B8%8E%E6%94%B6%E8%97%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8B%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%B5%3E%3E%20https://xhslink.com/m/6nrgx3NOSvD" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/624eb143eea090911200faad/create/%E6%88%91%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%8F%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%A6%E6%94%B6%E8%8E%B7%E4%BA%8621.9%E4%B8%87%E6%AC%A1%E8%B5%9E%E4%B8%8E%E6%94%B6%E8%97%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9D%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8B%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%B5%3E%3E%20https://xhslink.com/m/6nrgx3NOSvD"><span>一只叫斧头的橘猫</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM:日落黄昏（吉他曲）</span></p>]]></description>
